{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x^2 = 2 mod 4: no solution (2 is not a square mod 4)\n  how: 4 = 2^2: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT\n  check: brute force over 0..3: 0 solutions\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "sqrtmod", "ucas": "sqrtmod 2 mod 4", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "sqrtmod", "modulus": "4: no solution", "solutions": 0, "method": "4 = 2^2: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT", "lhs": "x^2", "annotation": "2 is not a square mod 4", "value": "2", "value_int": 2, "headline": "x^2 = 2 mod 4: no solution (2 is not a square mod 4)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "brute force over 0..3: 0 solutions"}], "files": [], "text": "x^2 = 2 mod 4: no solution (2 is not a square mod 4)\n  how: 4 = 2^2: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT\n  check: brute force over 0..3: 0 solutions\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x^2 = 3 mod 7: no solution (3 is not a square mod 7)\n  how: Euler's criterion (a square mod an odd prime p has a^((p-1)/2) = 1)\n  check: Euler's criterion 3^((7-1)/2) = 6 != 1; brute force over 0..6: 0 solutions\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "sqrtmod", "ucas": "sqrtmod 3 mod 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "sqrtmod", "modulus": "7: no solution", "solutions": 0, "method": "Euler's criterion (a square mod an odd prime p has a^((p-1)/2) = 1)", "lhs": "x^2", "annotation": "3 is not a square mod 7", "value": "3", "value_int": 3, "headline": "x^2 = 3 mod 7: no solution (3 is not a square mod 7)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "Euler's criterion 3^((7-1)/2) = 6 != 1; brute force over 0..6: 0 solutions"}], "files": [], "text": "x^2 = 3 mod 7: no solution (3 is not a square mod 7)\n  how: Euler's criterion (a square mod an odd prime p has a^((p-1)/2) = 1)\n  check: Euler's criterion 3^((7-1)/2) = 6 != 1; brute force over 0..6: 0 solutions\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x^2 = 0 mod 8: x = 0, 4\n  how: 8 = 2^3: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT\n  check: 0^2 = 0, 4^2 = 0 (mod 8); brute force over 0..7: 2 solutions\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "sqrtmod", "ucas": "sqrtmod 0 mod 8", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "sqrtmod", "modulus": "8", "solutions": 2, "roots": [0, 4], "method": "8 = 2^3: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT", "headline": "x^2 = 0 mod 8: x = 0, 4"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "0^2 = 0, 4^2 = 0 (mod 8); brute force over 0..7: 2 solutions"}], "files": [], "text": "x^2 = 0 mod 8: x = 0, 4\n  how: 8 = 2^3: roots mod each prime (Tonelli-Shanks), lifted to the prime powers (Hensel), combined by CRT\n  check: 0^2 = 0, 4^2 = 0 (mod 8); brute force over 0..7: 2 solutions\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x^2 = 2 mod 7: x = 3, 4\n  how: p = 3 mod 4: x = a^((p+1)/4)\n  check: 3^2 = 2, 4^2 = 2 (mod 7); brute force over 0..6: 2 solutions\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "sqrtmod", "ucas": "sqrtmod 2 mod 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "sqrtmod", "modulus": "7", "solutions": 2, "roots": [3, 4], "method": "p = 3 mod 4: x = a^((p+1)/4)", "headline": "x^2 = 2 mod 7: x = 3, 4"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "3^2 = 2, 4^2 = 2 (mod 7); brute force over 0..6: 2 solutions"}], "files": [], "text": "x^2 = 2 mod 7: x = 3, 4\n  how: p = 3 mod 4: x = a^((p+1)/4)\n  check: 3^2 = 2, 4^2 = 2 (mod 7); brute force over 0..6: 2 solutions\n"}, "isError": false}}
